style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱将一枚纱布贴在面前人的脸上。方才短暂的冲突已让青年负了伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德则收起手枪，抱着手站在一旁，听着另一人的讲述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>我是米哈伊尔，被您制服的是我的战友阿列克谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>我们是从邻近的多洛夫卡镇上来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你们都是从前线撤下来的士兵吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>是的，停战协定签署后，我们从布列斯特撤退，来到镇上的医院养伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>我和阿列克谢这次出来本是想寻找支援，但并不顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>在回去之前，我们想着如果能在这里找到一些药品带回去也是好的，医院里太缺药了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>医院遭遇了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>米哈伊尔来回打量着玛尔纱与阿德海德，在看清玛尔纱胸前的标识时，眼睛亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>三天前，我们得到消息，有一队本应撤离的重塑之手又折返了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>他们一路清扫残余的军队力量，控制了沿途的交通线路，打算消灭所有潜在威胁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>——而他们……将在一天内抵达多洛夫卡镇，医院来不及撤退了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>玛尔纱医生，您来自圣洛夫基金会对吗？我认得您胸前这枚标识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>米哈伊尔恳切的目光落在玛尔纱身上，渴望她能应下他的言外之意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我的确来自基金会。米哈伊尔，医院里一共滞留了多少人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>一百人左右，除了医生和护士，大多是些没有什么力气的伤患。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>重塑之手一旦包围医院，后果不堪设想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱迅速在脑海里理清了局势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我会联系驻扎在森城的基金会小队，向他们说明情况，请求他们派去更多支援。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>不过他们应当赶不上重塑之手抵达镇上的时间了，在此之前……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱望向阿德海德，后者低着头，不知在想些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>米哈伊尔，我需要同阿德海德修士商量一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我会尽量争取她的同意，先跟你们回医院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-530801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">米哈伊尔：</div><div>玛尔纱医生，谢谢你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身后，阿德海德已打开门，走了出去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋外，阿德海德摘下了腰间系着的那块小盾牌，拿在手里摩挲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从废弃的铁桶上取下的金属，薄薄一片，凹凸不平，棱角并未经过专业的打磨，粗糙得有些硌手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱，明天的这个时候，也许我们已成功伏击了重塑之手的车队，夺回骑士团的财宝了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，熹光已浅淡地为天际线晕染出透明的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……是的，但也是在同一时刻，那座医院就会沦陷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，医院里的人需要我们的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德皱着眉，眼神却不自觉地描摹着盾牌上稚嫩的孩童手笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯塔希并不知道高地骑士团的那座城堡是何模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但经由阿德海德的讲述，他想象出了那座耸立在山巅之上的，百年来都屹立不倒的建筑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巍峨森严的城堡里，世代居住着恪守正义与公平的原则、愿意保卫弱者的骑士们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德正是从这座城堡启程，辗转来到森城救下了一名高烧不退的男孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>被劫掠走的财宝，是骑士团耻辱的象征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>作为骑士团代理大团长，没能及时阻止重塑之手对骑士团不义的侵占已是一种渎职。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>如今在得知他们的消息后，更没有理由放任他们转移我们的财产却无所作为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我得夺回来，才能给骑士团的众人一个交代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德神情挣扎地望着眼前这条通向城镇中心的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>“你将成为弱者的守护者，你将以一己之力成为他们的盾。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德自嘲地笑了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>《骑士的礼仪与誓约》里的内容，我们出征前，总要重申它的要求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>骑士的尊严与弱者的生命，不该被放在天平两端衡量，做出取舍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>但现实却只留下了二选一的命题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱走到阿德海德身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，斯塔希当初怎么会想到要用这块盾牌来答谢你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德瞥了一眼玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我治好了他的高烧，从死神手里保护了他，于是他也想保护我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>小孩的好意朴素，但总是赤诚的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在场的骑士都知道，这块盾牌不会在生死搏杀中起到太多帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但阿德海德并没有丢下，她始终将它系在腰间，尽管这块盾牌只似孩童的玩具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>骑士的仁慈与良善不该奢求回报，它必须成为我们的秉性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>但阿德海德，你的仁慈仍然没有落空，你手上握着的这块盾牌，就是骑士的尊严。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这也许并非二选一的命题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱的声音很轻，轻到仿若原野上茅草的簌簌细响，然而它却时刻流入耳内，不容忽视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……错过这一次，就不知道下一次夺回骑士团财产的机会要等到什么时候了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>但骑士团的未来还很长——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>长到我们可以有无数次机会满载荣誉，重新填满空空如也的城堡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我们可以拥有一个新的开始，纯粹回归“骑士”身份的开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱语气坚定。她知道，阿德海德本就已在动摇，此刻只需要一个助力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而阿德海德手中这块盾牌，也在提醒她，不要舍弃初心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……我还记得，以前比起成为背着受伤同胞撤离的人，你更愿意成为第一个迎向敌人的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>战争会让所有人发生不可逆转的改变，但我希望，我身上的改变能通向明天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……走吧，有我们二人，也许能让医院撑到基金会派来援兵的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱安心地舒了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>谢谢你，阿德海德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随即，玛尔纱拿出了基金会的联络器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>“剃刀”先生，现在出现了紧急情况……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德再度看了一眼手中的盾牌，接着将它系回了腰间。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四人一路疾行，终于在正午时分赶到了多洛夫卡镇。路的尽头，医院的轮廓逐渐清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而，一同出现的，还有在医院外围燃起的硝烟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-563301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-563301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-563301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿列克谢：</div><div>该死！重塑之手提前到达医院了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>慢着，阿列克谢！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱一把拉住正要冲出去的士兵，她仔细凝望着远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>重塑之手被阻拦在医院外了，他们似乎在同什么人作战……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>咦？那是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>榴弹的火光之中，淬火钢明灭闪烁着丝丝缕缕的银光，马儿嘶鸣急踏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531805.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>错不了，是骑士团的人在抵抗重塑之手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德笃定地给出了答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这附近居然还有其他骑士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>震惊过后，酸涩的喜悦与欣慰一同涌了上来，几乎让玛尔纱热了眼眶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>快，我们也加快脚步！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她带着米哈伊尔与阿列克谢迅速向前跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德落后了几步。玛尔纱的背影落在她的眼里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一瞬间，似乎与很久以前那个莽撞的小姑娘重合了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但奔跑的风吹起她灰绿色的外套，露出了护士服的衣角。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-3_3_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高地骑士团数十名骑士意料之外的援助，迅速瓦解了重塑之手的攻势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医院外，骑士们清扫着战场，确保场上敌人已无生命迹象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>重塑之手的进攻被高地骑士团击退了，医院已安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我会与医院负责人接洽，了解具体的损失与伤亡情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-510410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>小队不会返程，将在傍晚抵达。医院依旧需要药物与人力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刚结束通讯，玛尔纱便被拥入一个热烈的怀抱之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>玛尔纱，你居然还活着！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾与玛尔纱一同接受骑士训练的童年伙伴难以掩饰自己的欣喜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱也用力回抱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>是的，希尔达，我活下来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>真高兴能在这里遇上你！但你们怎么会出现在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>我们本不会前往这里，但路上从撤离的民众那儿听闻了这里的情况。幸好及时赶上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-531902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希尔德加德：</div><div>不仅如此，还能遇上阿德海德团长和你，这真的太好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德没有打扰骑士同胞之间的重逢与交流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听着希尔德加德的话，不知想到了什么，一时陷入了深思。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "以骑士之名-05"}}